cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Emu-GMM: Measure-Theoretic Generalized Method of Moments Estimation"
abstract: >-
  Generalized method of moments estimation formulated measure-theoretically,
  with estimation via E_mu.  One operator interface -- implemented against
  empirical, analytical, or synthetic measures -- drives sample estimation,
  identification analysis, and simulation-based inference through a single
  JAX-native pipeline.  Variance construction is orthogonal to integration:
  E_mu[psi] is a property of the measure, while V_mu(theta) is a property of a
  separate CovarianceStrategy that can be swapped without changing what is being
  integrated.  Companion to ManifoldGMM, which implements GMM on Riemannian
  manifolds.
